# profile, the scrolling histogram: reads number [colour] lines from standard input (profile.in, 150 values of two sines, a colour change every
# 25: red, blue, dark green); it starts paused, so the pause button is pressed to let the data flow; at the end of the stream it asks
# End of stream. with Quit, Snapshot and Hold, and Return (Quit, the default) ends the program by itself
move 49 51
press 1
release 1
wait
move 325 150
key Return
